<title>ROMANIA: Romania producer prices 2.4 pct up in Dec '96.</title>
<headline>Romania producer prices 2.4 pct up in Dec '96.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry rose by 2.4 percent last December from the previous month, National Statistics Board data showed on Friday.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	 DEC 96   NOV 96    DEC 95</p>
<p>  mth/mth change		     +2.4     +2.1	+2.6</p>
<p>  extraction industry		+0.2     +0.4	+0.1</p>
<p>  processing industry		+2.9     +2.6	+3.1</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	  +0.2     +0.0	+0.2</p>
<p>-- Luli Popescu, Bucharest Newsroom, 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
